{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43730","headline":"句 · 卞震","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨壁长秋菌，风枝落病蝉。\n老筇搘瘦影，寒木凭吟身。\n诗债到春无处避，离愁因醉暂时无。\n茶香解睡磨铛煮，山色牵怀着屐登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卞震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}